<title>USA: Sprint president resigns to head Waste Mgt.</title>
<headline>Sprint president resigns to head Waste Mgt.</headline>
<dateline>KANSAS CITY, Mo. 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sprint Corp said Monday Ronald LeMay, president and chief operating officer, resigned to become chairman, president and chief executive officer of Oak Brook, Ill.-based Waste Management Inc .</p>
<p>William Esrey, Sprint chairman and chief executive officer, will assume responsibility for the chief executive officer and chief operating officer positions.</p>
